COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D8C$.START2 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for the second spatial dimension.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D8C$.END2 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for the second spatial dimension.';
