COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D8C$.END3 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for the third spatial dimension.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D8C$.AVGMBRLEN3 IS 'Average extent or length of the minimum bounding rectangles along the third dimension.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$ IS 'Internal Oracle Spatial temporary table used during spatial index creation or analysis to store boundary and density statistics across up to three dimensions.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.NUM_MBRS IS 'Number of spatial members or geometries contained within the partition or index node.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.START1 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for dimension 1.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.END1 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for dimension 1.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.AVGMBRLEN1 IS 'Average length or extent of member geometries along dimension 1.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.START2 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for dimension 2.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.END2 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for dimension 2.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.AVGMBRLEN2 IS 'Average length or extent of member geometries along dimension 2.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.START3 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for dimension 3.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.END3 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for dimension 3.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15D96$.AVGMBRLEN3 IS 'Average length or extent of member geometries along dimension 3.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$ IS 'Internal Oracle Spatial index temporary or working table (MDXT) storing dimensional boundary extents and member statistics across up to three dimensions.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.NUM_MBRS IS 'Number of spatial members or geometries contained within the extent cell.';
