COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.START2 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for Dimension 2 (e.g., Y/Latitude).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.END2 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for Dimension 2 (e.g., Y/Latitude).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.AVGMBRLEN2 IS 'Average length or extent span of members along Dimension 2.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.START3 IS 'Starting coordinate or lower boundary for Dimension 3 (e.g., Z/Altitude).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.END3 IS 'Ending coordinate or upper boundary for Dimension 3 (e.g., Z/Altitude).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DE5$.AVGMBRLEN3 IS 'Average length or extent span of members along Dimension 3.';

