COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DEE$.AVGMBRLEN2 IS 'Average length of the Minimum Bounding Rectangles (MBRs) along dimension 2.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DEE$.START3 IS 'Lower coordinate boundary (minimum value) for dimension 3.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DEE$.END3 IS 'Upper coordinate boundary (maximum value) for dimension 3.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.MDXT_15DEE$.AVGMBRLEN3 IS 'Average length of the Minimum Bounding Rectangles (MBRs) along dimension 3.';
