COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.ADDRESS1 IS 'Primary street address of the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.ADDRESS2 IS 'Secondary address details such as suite, unit, or apartment number.';
