COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.STATE IS 'State abbreviation or province where the property is located.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.ZIPCODE IS 'Postal or ZIP code of the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.ACREAGE IS 'Total land area of the property measured in acres.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.SQ_FT IS 'Total area of the property in square feet.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.GEO_LOCATION IS 'Spatial geometry object representing the geographic coordinates of the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTIES_V.CHECKSUM IS 'System-generated hash of key property attributes used for optimistic locking and change detection.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LINKS IS 'Stores external web links and references associated with properties recorded in PR_PROPERTIES.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LINKS.PROP_ID IS 'Foreign key referencing PR_PROPERTIES.PROP_ID; identifies the associated property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LINKS.URL IS 'Web address or URL link related to the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LINKS.TITLE IS 'Descriptive title or label for the web link.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V IS 'View based on PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS providing property listing details, agent contact information, and an optimistic locking checksum.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.PROP_ID IS 'Unique identifier of the property associated with the listing.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.BUSINESS_ID IS 'Identifier of the business or operating entity associated with the listing.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.LISTING_DATE IS 'Date when the property listing was created or posted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.PRICE IS 'Listing price for the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.PUBLISH_YN IS 'Flag indicating whether the listing is published for public viewing (Y/N).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.SOLD_YN IS 'Flag indicating whether the listed property has been sold (Y/N).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.DESCRIPTION IS 'Detailed text description or marketing remarks for the property listing.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.SOURCE IS 'Source or channel through which the listing originated or is advertised.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.AGENT_NAME IS 'Name of the listing agent representing the property.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.AGENT_PHONE IS 'Contact telephone number for the listing agent.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_LISTINGS_V.AGENT_EMAIL IS 'Email address for the listing agent.';
