COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_OWNERS.MAILING_ID IS 'Foreign key referencing PR_PROPERTIES indicating the property used as the mailing address.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_OWNERS.ADDRESS1 IS 'Primary street address line for the owner''s mailing address.';
