COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_USAGE_V.CHECKSUM IS 'System-generated checksum hash of the record data, used for optimistic locking and concurrency control.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PROPERTY_VALUES IS 'Stores financial metrics, operating expense assumptions, and calculated property valuations.';
