COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PROP_CLASS_V IS 'View providing property classification details from PR_PROP_CLASS along with a calculated record checksum for data integrity and optimistic locking.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROP_CLASS_V.PROP_CLASS IS 'Unique code identifying the property classification.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROP_CLASS_V.DESCRIPTION IS 'Text description or label of the property classification.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PROP_CLASS_V.CHECKSUM IS 'Calculated hash checksum of the row values, used for detecting concurrent updates.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PUMS_DATA IS 'Stores Public Use Microdata Sample (PUMS) demographic and housing statistics by Public Use Microdata Area (PUMA), used for market and property analysis.';
