COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PUMS_DATA.RENT_INCOME_RATIO IS 'Average or median ratio of gross rent to household income within the PUMA.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PUMS_DATA.INSURANCE IS 'Estimated or benchmark property insurance cost within the PUMA.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_PUMS_DATA.VACANCY_RATE IS 'Housing or rental vacancy rate percentage within the PUMA.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_PUMS_VALUES IS 'Stores statistical percentile distribution values for demographic and housing metrics by Public Use Microdata Area (PUMA), referencing PR_PUMS_DATA.';
