COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.ASMNT_YR IS 'Tax assessment roll year.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.ATV_STRT IS 'Assessment value stratum code or number.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.GRP_NO IS 'Stratum group number used for assessment ratio studies.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.DOR_UC IS 'Department of Revenue (DOR) property land use code.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.NBRHD_CD IS 'Neighborhood code defined by the local property appraiser.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.MKT_AR IS 'Market area code assigned to the parcel.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.CENSUS_BK IS 'U.S. Census block identifier.';
