COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.OR_PAGE IS 'Official Records page number where the deed is recorded.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.CLERK_NO IS 'Clerk of Court recording or instrument number.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.QUAL_CD IS 'Sale qualification code indicating if the sale is an arm''s-length transaction.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.SALE_YR IS 'Four-digit calendar year in which the sale occurred.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.SALE_MO IS 'Two-digit month in which the sale occurred.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.SALE_PRC IS 'Total recorded sale price of the property transaction.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.MULTI_PAR_SAL IS 'Multi-parcel sale indicator flag (e.g., ''M'' if sale involves multiple parcels).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_SDF.RS_ID IS 'Repeat sale or resale tracking identifier.';
