COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_UCODE_DATA.PROPERTY_COUNT IS 'Total number of properties associated with the specified city and usage code.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_UCODE_DATA.TOTAL_SQFT IS 'Total aggregate square footage of properties for the specified city and usage code.';

