COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.PROP_CLASS IS 'Property classification code, referencing PR_PROP_CLASS.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.YEAR IS 'Applicable calendar year for the valuation metrics and benchmarks.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.MIN_PRICE IS 'Minimum property price or valuation for this category and year.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.MAX_PRICE IS 'Maximum property price or valuation for this category and year.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.MEDIAN_PRICE IS 'Median property price or valuation for this category and year.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.RENT IS 'Estimated or benchmark rental rate amount for the property category.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.REPLACEMENT IS 'Estimated replacement cost for properties in this category.';
