COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.MGT_PERCENT IS 'Standard property management fee percentage.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.CAP_RATE IS 'Capitalization rate percentage benchmark for the property category.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.VACANCY_PERCENT IS 'Projected vacancy rate percentage benchmark.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.UTILITIES IS 'Estimated utility expenses for properties in this category.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES.CURRENT_YN IS 'Flag indicating whether this record represents the current active benchmark values (Y/N).';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V IS 'View based on PR_VALUES that exposes annual property valuation and market benchmark metrics, including price ranges, rental estimates, expense ratios, and a computed row checksum.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.CITY_ID IS 'Unique identifier of the city or market location.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.UCODE IS 'Unique area, zip, or unit classification code associated with the property value record.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.PROP_CLASS IS 'Property classification code or category.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.YEAR IS 'Reference calendar year for the valuation and market statistics.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.MIN_PRICE IS 'Minimum property market or sale price recorded for the class and year.';
