COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.MEDIAN_PRICE IS 'Median property market or sale price for the class and year.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.RENT IS 'Estimated or average rental income rate for the property class.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.VACANCY_PERCENT IS 'Estimated vacancy rate percentage.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.REPLACEMENT IS 'Estimated replacement reserve or capital improvement cost.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.MAINTENANCE IS 'Estimated ongoing maintenance and repair cost.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.MGT_PERCENT IS 'Property management fee percentage.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.CAP_RATE IS 'Capitalization rate (cap rate) percentage for valuation.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.UTILITIES IS 'Estimated utility expense amount.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VALUES_V.CHECKSUM IS 'System-generated checksum hash used for optimistic locking and data integrity verification.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PR_VOLUSIA_IDS IS 'Cross-reference mapping table storing various parcel identification formats and alternate keys for real property records in Volusia County.';
