COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PR_VOLUSIA_IDS.SHORT_PARCEL_ID IS 'Abbreviated or condensed format of the parcel identification number.';

COMMENT ON TABLE RNTMGR2.PUMA_DECODE IS 'Crosswalk reference table mapping U.S. Census 2000 Public Use Microdata Areas (PUMAs) to 2010/2012 PUMAs, including population counts and geographic allocation factors.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.PUMA_DECODE.STATE IS 'Federal Information Processing Standard (FIPS) numeric code for the state.';
