COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.PAYMENT_DUE_DATE IS 'Date when the payable amount is due to be paid.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.AMOUNT IS 'Monetary amount due or payable for the expense.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.PAYMENT_TYPE_ID IS 'Foreign key referencing the payment method or payment type.';
