COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.BUSINESS_ID IS 'Identifier of the business entity or operating company.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.PAYMENT_TYPE_NAME IS 'Descriptive name of the payment type or method.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.PAYMENT_DATE IS 'Date when the payment allocation was made or processed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.RECORD_TYPE IS 'Category code indicating the AP record type (e.g., expense or generated payable).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN RNTMGR2.RNT_ACCNTS_PAYABLE_EXPENSES_V.INVOICE_NUMBER IS 'Invoice or reference number provided by the supplier.';

